Z||000000||Ken Wittlief||12-27-2001||02:25 PM||||My kids are older now but I remember when they were children, shopping for christmans toys for them, and walking through stores like ToysRus from one end to the other and thinking "all these toys in here are all Junk!"<P>I always wished there was 'something else' to get the kids for christmas<P>If you could have a toy company or a new business create a toy for your kid, what you you ask them to design/create/invent?<P>One of the neatest toys Ive seen in the last few years is the Rokenbok truck sets - <A HREF="http://www.rokenbok.com/-" TARGET=_blank>http://www.rokenbok.com/-</A>  they make little radio contolled trucks about 6 inches long that had dump trucks and high loaders... - and they go along with lego sets perfectly.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Ken Wittlief (edited 12-27-2001).]||||reg||5
